# scenario: saving-broken
# The stored wallet cannot open: the problem instead of figures, no Send,
# Receive or Refill, and "Set up again" offers the stored device alone.
click Saving
expect Fedimix could not read the account from the wallet you chose.
expect —
expect-not No activity yet
expect-not 0 BTC
shot tab
click Set up again
expect Connect your Ledger Nano S+ and set up again
expect-not This computer
shot setup-again
close-dialog
click Spending
expect of 0.05 target
expect-not Refill from Saving
